-- הוראת תכ"ם H.13.4.7 — החזר הוצאות טלפון קווי אישי (גרסה 1, 1.8.2008)
-- The Accountant-General's instruction, written with the Civil Service
-- Commission, on refunding senior role holders in the government ministries
-- for using their home landline for work: who is entitled and at which
-- level (annex B), who is "existing" and who "new" (annex A), the
-- inter-ministerial committee that decides the exceptions, the duties of a
-- ministry's deputy director-general for administration and its
-- accountant, the end of the ministries' direct contract with Bezeq on
-- 1.4.2009, the fixed monthly sum (priced by notice HOD.13.4.7.1, imported
-- here), its tax and payroll code, and the declaration each holder signs
-- and renews every two years, without which there is no refund.
--
-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in months from the day the
-- holder's entitlement is approved (0).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `2008-12-01_takam_HOD-13-4-7-1_telefon-ramot-zakaut_v1`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: ‘בעל’ is ‘בעל תפקיד’, the
-- holder of a post, not a husband; the instruction refunds phone expenses
-- by post and level, and makes no distinction by sex.

§ `החזר הוצאות טלפון קווי אישי`

@desc A post annex B of instruction H.13.4.7 names, in either edition; any other post is `another landline post`.
DECLARE `landline post` IS ONE OF
    `an aide to a minister or deputy minister`                   @desc עוזר שר או סגן שר
    `a senior professional aide to a minister`                   @desc עוזר מקצועי בכיר לשר
    `a senior professional aide to a deputy minister`            @desc עוזר מקצועי בכיר לסגן שר
    `a senior professional aide to a director-general`           @desc "ומנהלים כללים", as read (F-2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1-b)
    `an adviser to a minister`                                   @desc יועץ שר
    `an adviser to a deputy minister`                            @desc יועץ סגן שר
    `a ministry spokesperson`                                    @desc דובר
    `a minister's bureau chief`                                  @desc מנהל לשכת שר
    `a deputy minister's bureau chief`                           @desc מנהל לשכת סגן שר
    `a ministry security officer`                                @desc קצין ביטחון (ממונה על הביטחון)
    `a ministry district director`                               @desc מנהל מחוז
    `a senior deputy to the legal adviser`                       @desc סגן בכיר ליועץ המשפטי
    `a deputy accountant`                                        @desc סגן חשב
    `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` @desc סגן מנהל כללי או תפקיד מקביל שמתח הדרגות במשרתו 44-42 ומעלה בדירוגים המקצועיים, או בדרגה מקבילה בדירוג המנהלי
    `a senior division head`                                     @desc מנהל אגף בכיר
    `a head of an auxiliary unit not of director-general standing` @desc מנהל יחידת סמך שאינו במעמד מנהל כללי
    `an associate director-general graded 44-46`                 @desc משנה למנהל הכללי שדרגתו בתקן 46-44 בדירוגים המקצועיים, או בדרגה מקבילה בדירוג המנהלי
    `another landline post`

@desc A role holder who asks for the personal-landline refund, as far as instruction H.13.4.7 asks about him.
DECLARE `landline role holder` HAS
    `the landline post`                                   IS A `landline post`
    `place among the bureau's aides`                      IS A NUMBER  @desc for an aide to a minister or deputy minister: his place among the bureau's aides (1 for the first)
    `took up the landline post on`                        IS A DATE    @desc the day he took up the post, by appointment or as acting or substitute
    `holds the landline post as acting or substitute`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc "במינוי בפועל או כממלא מקום"
    `entitled to a landline refund without limit`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc one of the other holders §1.3 keeps under their existing arrangements
    `the landline level the committee approved`           IS A MAYBE `landline entitlement level` @desc a level the inter-ministerial committee approved for him, if any
    `signed a landline declaration`                       IS A BOOLEAN @desc signed annex D
    `last signed the landline declaration on`             IS A DATE
    `has a home landline usable for work`                 IS A BOOLEAN @desc annex D's first condition
    `is ready to use the home landline for work`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc annex D's second condition

DECLARE `landline party` IS ONE OF
    `the deputy director-general for administration`
    `the ministry's accountant for the landline refund`
    `the landline role holder`
    `the inter-ministerial landline committee`
    `the salary unit's manager`

DECLARE `landline action` IS ONE OF
    `decide a landline case`
    `check the existing holders against annex B, with the accountant`
    `refer the holders who fail annex B to the inter-ministerial committee`
    `check the new holders against annex B`
    `notify the accountant of a cancelled entitlement or a changed level`
    `arrange paying the phone bill directly with a provider of his choice`
    `sign the landline declaration`
    `renew the landline declaration`
    `pay the landline refund`
    `bring the landline instruction to the entitled holders' notice`
    `fill in the level and the sum on the landline declaration`

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- §1.1–1.3: senior role holders in the State service are paid for using
-- their home landline for work; the instruction applies to every holder
-- entitled under annex B, whatever phone company he chose, and not to the
-- other holders entitled to a refund without limit, whose existing
-- arrangements continue.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the landline instruction of 2008 applies to` h IF
    NOT h's `entitled to a landline refund without limit`

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-4 The instruction's purpose: to set the rules for refunding senior role holders' personal-landline expenses; no rule of its own.

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-5 A pointer to the definitions of annex A, encoded there.

§§ `2.1–2.2 הוועדה הבין-משרדית`

-- §2.1: the inter-ministerial committee for personal phones and its three
-- members; the head of the senior division for planning and control at the
-- Civil Service Commission chairs it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3
DECLARE `landline committee seat` IS ONE OF
    `the head of the senior division for planning and control at the Civil Service Commission`
    `a senior deputy to the Accountant-General or his representative`
    `a senior deputy to the Wages and Labour Agreements Commissioner`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1
GIVEN s IS A `landline committee seat`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chairs the inter-ministerial landline committee` s IF
    s EQUALS `the head of the senior division for planning and control at the Civil Service Commission`

-- §2.2: from 1.4.2009 the committee hears only the exceptional cases that
-- do not meet annex B's criteria; before that day the text does not limit
-- it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2
GIVEN `the case meets annex B` IS A BOOLEAN
      t IS A DATE @desc the day the committee would decide the case
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `the landline committee's reach under §2.2 of 2008` `the case meets annex B` t IS
    IF      t `is on or after` `the day the landline arrangement of 2008 starts`
        AND `the case meets annex B`
    THEN PARTY `the inter-ministerial landline committee`
         SHANT `decide a landline case`
    ELSE PARTY `the inter-ministerial landline committee`
         MAY   `decide a landline case`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
`the day the landline arrangement of 2008 starts` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2009

§§ `2.3 בעל תפקיד קיים`

-- §2.3.1: the deputy director-general for administration, with the
-- ministry's accountant, checks whether the existing holders entitled to a
-- refund meet annex B; any who do not he refers to the inter-ministerial
-- committee. The text sets no deadline (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1
GIVEN `some existing holders fail annex B` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `the check of the existing landline holders` `some existing holders fail annex B` IS
    IF `some existing holders fail annex B`
    THEN PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
         MUST  `check the existing holders against annex B, with the accountant`
         HENCE PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
               MUST  `refer the holders who fail annex B to the inter-ministerial committee`
    ELSE PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
         MUST  `check the existing holders against annex B, with the accountant`

-- §2.3.2: from 1.4.2009 the ministries' direct contract with Bezeq ends,
-- and each entitled holder pays his phone bill directly to any landline
-- company he chooses (§2.6.1 and annex D repeat it, and annex D adds that
-- the State has stopped paying Bezeq for his home phone).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p7
GIVEN t IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ministry pays Bezeq directly for the home landline on` t IF
    NOT t `is on or after` `the day the landline arrangement of 2008 starts`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6__cls_2-6-1 akn:att_4__hc_1/p6
GIVEN t IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `paying the landline bill directly` t IS
    IF t `is on or after` `the day the landline arrangement of 2008 starts`
    THEN PARTY `the landline role holder`
         MUST  `arrange paying the phone bill directly with a provider of his choice`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §2.3.3, §2.4.3 and annex D: every sum approved is taxed in full ("ביטול
-- זקיפת ההטבה", the notice §3.2 names, is not in the corpus), and the
-- payment is reported under annex C.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8
`the landline refund is taxed in full` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2.4 בעל תפקיד חדש`

-- §2.4.1: from 1.12.2008 the deputy director-general for administration
-- and the ministry's accountant are responsible for checking that new
-- holders meet annex B.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-1
GIVEN t IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `the check of a new landline holder` t IS
    IF t `is on or after` `the day the new landline holders start`
    THEN (PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
          MUST  `check the new holders against annex B`)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the ministry's accountant for the landline refund`
          MUST  `check the new holders against annex B`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1
`the day the new landline holders start` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008

-- §2.4.4: the deputy director-general tells the accountant of every
-- cancelled entitlement and every change of level; no deadline.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-4
GIVEN `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `telling the accountant of a landline change` `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed` IS
    IF `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed`
    THEN PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
         MUST  `notify the accountant of a cancelled entitlement or a changed level`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `2.5 הצהרה`

-- §2.5.1–2.5.2 and §2.6.2: with the approval of his entitlement the holder
-- signs annex D, and renews it once every two years; a holder who did not
-- sign, or did not renew, is not entitled to the refund. Time in months
-- from the approval.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6__cls_2-6-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `the landline declaration duty` IS
    PARTY `the landline role holder`
    MUST  `sign the landline declaration`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE (PARTY `the landline role holder`
           MUST  `renew the landline declaration`
           WITHIN 24
           LEST  PARTY `the ministry's accountant for the landline refund`
                 SHANT `pay the landline refund`)
    LEST  PARTY `the ministry's accountant for the landline refund`
          SHANT `pay the landline refund`

-- The same as a condition of the refund on a day: he signed, and the day
-- is not later than two years from his last signature. "אחת לשנתיים"
-- gives the renewal until the day two years on, which is in the period
-- (convention dates.end); a date is compared as year, month and day, so
-- a signature on 29.2 has its anniversary on 28.2 or 1.3 as the calendar
-- has it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
      t IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the landline declaration holds on` h t IF
        h's `signed a landline declaration`
    AND t `is on or after` (h's `last signed the landline declaration on`)
    AND `the calendar number of` t AT MOST `the calendar number of` (h's `last signed the landline declaration on`) PLUS 20000

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the calendar number of` d IS
    DATE_YEAR d TIMES 10000 PLUS DATE_MONTH d TIMES 100 PLUS DATE_DAY d

-- §2.6: the deputy director-general for administration in each ministry
-- brings the instruction to the entitled holders' notice and makes clear
-- what each must do (§2.6.1, §2.6.2, encoded above); no deadline.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `publishing the landline instruction in the ministry` IS
    PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
    MUST  `bring the landline instruction to the entitled holders' notice`

-- akn:hc_1__para_3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2 The list of applicable documents: the notice that prices the levels (imported) and the notice that ends the imputed benefit (not in the corpus); no rule.

-- akn:hc_1__para_4 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-1 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-2 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-3 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-4 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-5 The list of annexes A to E, each encoded where it is printed; no rule.

§§ `נספח א הגדרות`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- Annex A as written. ¶1: a holder appointed from 1.12.2008 is "new", and
-- so is one who "from 1 December" served by acting or substitute
-- appointment; ¶2: a holder appointed up to 30.11.2008 is "existing", and
-- so is one who on 30 November served by acting or substitute appointment.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new landline holder under annex A as written` h IF
       h's `holds the landline post as acting or substitute`
    OR (h's `took up the landline post on`) `is on or after` `the day the new landline holders start`

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing landline holder under annex A as written` h IF
    (h's `took up the landline post on`) `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008)

-- F-2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1-a: a holder acting in
-- the post on 30.11.2008 who is still acting on 1.12.2008 is "existing"
-- by ¶2 and "new" by ¶1, and the notice pays the two differently. The
-- encoding reads ¶1's "מיום 1 בדצמבר" as acting service that began on that
-- day or after (convention dates.period-by-start): the standing is the
-- one of the day the holder took up the post.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A `landline role-holder standing`
DECIDE `the landline standing of` h IS
    IF (h's `took up the landline post on`) `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008)
    THEN `an existing landline role holder`
    ELSE `a new landline role holder`

§§ `נספח ב הקריטריונים`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- "עד 3 עוזרים בלשכה": a cap on a count of people, so the third aide is
-- within it (convention thresholds.until, its exception for such caps).
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-1
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the bureau's three landline aides` h IF
    h's `place among the bureau's aides` AT MOST 3

-- Annex B for existing holders. Level א is approved at the discretion of
-- the inter-ministerial committee (the committee's level, below); level ב
-- for the aides of a minister or deputy minister (three in a bureau at
-- most), senior professional aides to the minister and to directors-general
-- (F-2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1-b), spokespersons, a
-- minister's bureau chief, security officers, district directors, a senior
-- deputy to the legal adviser and a minister's adviser; level ג for a
-- deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above, senior
-- division heads and heads of auxiliary units not of director-general
-- standing; level ד for an associate director-general graded 44-46.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-7 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-8 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_3/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_4/p2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the level annex B of 2008 gives an existing holder` h IS
    CONSIDER h's `the landline post`
    WHEN `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` THEN
        IF `within the bureau's three landline aides` h THEN JUST `landline level B` ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a director-general` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a ministry spokesperson` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a minister's bureau chief` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a ministry security officer` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a ministry district director` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a senior deputy to the legal adviser` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `an adviser to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `a senior division head` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `a head of an auxiliary unit not of director-general standing` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `an associate director-general graded 44-46` THEN JUST `landline level D`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Annex B for new holders. Level א for the aides of a minister or deputy
-- minister (three at most), senior professional aides to the minister, the
-- deputy minister and directors-general, advisers to a minister and a
-- deputy minister, spokespersons, the bureau chief of a minister or deputy
-- minister, security officers and a deputy accountant; level ב for a deputy
-- director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above, senior
-- division heads, heads of auxiliary units not of director-general
-- standing, and an associate director-general graded 44-46 (the unnumbered
-- line under 2.1).
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-3 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-4 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-5 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-6 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_1__subpara_1-7 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_2__para_2__subpara_2-1/p2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the level annex B of 2008 gives a new holder` h IS
    CONSIDER h's `the landline post`
    WHEN `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` THEN
        IF `within the bureau's three landline aides` h THEN JUST `landline level A` ELSE NOTHING
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a deputy minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a director-general` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `an adviser to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `an adviser to a deputy minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a ministry spokesperson` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a minister's bureau chief` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a deputy minister's bureau chief` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a ministry security officer` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a deputy accountant` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a senior division head` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a head of an auxiliary unit not of director-general standing` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `an associate director-general graded 44-46` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- The level a holder is paid at (§2.3.3, §2.4.2): the one annex B gives
-- his post and standing, approved by the deputy director-general for
-- administration and the accountant; where annex B gives none, the level
-- the inter-ministerial committee approved, if it did (annex B's level א
-- for existing holders; §2.2's exceptions).
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__hc_1__para_1/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the landline level of 2008 for` h IS
    orElse (CONSIDER `the landline standing of` h
            WHEN `an existing landline role holder` THEN `the level annex B of 2008 gives an existing holder` h
            WHEN `a new landline role holder` THEN `the level annex B of 2008 gives a new holder` h)
           (h's `the landline level the committee approved`)

§§ `הסכום לתשלום`

-- §2.3.3–2.3.4 and §2.4.2, with annex D's two conditions: from 1.4.2009 an
-- existing holder is paid a fixed monthly sum by the level approved for
-- him, as notice HOD.13.4.7.1 prices it (until then the ministry paid
-- Bezeq for his phone directly); a new holder, from 1.12.2008, by the
-- level set for him. Nothing for a holder outside the instruction (§1.3),
-- without a level, without a declaration in force (§2.5.2), or who cannot
-- declare that a landline at home is there to be used for work and that he
-- will use it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-4 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8
@export The monthly personal-landline refund of a role holder in a month, under the first edition of instruction H.13.4.7 and its notice
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
      t IS A DATE @desc a day of the month paid
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` h t IS
    IF      `the landline instruction of 2008 applies to` h
        AND t `is on or after` (`the first day of the landline sum for` (`the landline standing of` h))
        AND `the landline declaration holds on` h t
        AND h's `has a home landline usable for work`
        AND h's `is ready to use the home landline for work`
    THEN CONSIDER `the landline level of 2008 for` h
         WHEN JUST l THEN `the monthly landline sum under notice edition 1` (`the landline standing of` h) l
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    ELSE NOTHING

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-1
GIVEN s IS A `landline role-holder standing`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the first day of the landline sum for` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `an existing landline role holder` THEN `the day the landline arrangement of 2008 starts`
    WHEN `a new landline role holder` THEN `the day the new landline holders start`

§§ `נספח ג ביצוע התשלום`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- Annex C: the refund is paid through Malam Systems, under this
-- instruction, as payroll code 4944, "personal landline expenses".
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2/t1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
`the payroll code of the landline refund` MEANS 4944

§§ `נספח ד הצהרה`

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 "כמו כן, ידוע לי כי:", the line that introduces what the holder acknowledges; the acknowledgements are encoded where they rest.

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/t1 The lines for the holder's name, signature and date; no rule.

-- Annex D's footnote: the salary unit's manager fills in the level and the
-- fixed sum on the form.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `landline party` `landline action`
DECIDE `completing the landline declaration` IS
    PARTY `the salary unit's manager`
    MUST  `fill in the level and the sum on the landline declaration`

§§ `נספח ה טבלת שינויים`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1/t1 The table of changes made in the edition, its header only: the first edition records no change; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Dates and posts are placeholders. A holder with a landline at home
-- that he is ready to use for work, who last signed annex D on 1.4.2009:
-- his post, his place among the bureau's aides, the day he took up the
-- post, whether he is acting, whether he is entitled without limit (§1.3),
-- the level the committee approved, and whether he signed.
GIVEN p IS A `landline post`
      n IS A NUMBER
      d IS A DATE
      a IS A BOOLEAN
      u IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
      s IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `landline role holder`
DECIDE `a sample landline holder` p n d a u c s IS
    `landline role holder` WITH
        `the landline post`                               IS p
        `place among the bureau's aides`                  IS n
        `took up the landline post on`                    IS d
        `holds the landline post as acting or substitute` IS a
        `entitled to a landline refund without limit`     IS u
        `the landline level the committee approved`       IS c
        `signed a landline declaration`                   IS s
        `last signed the landline declaration on`         IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2009
        `has a home landline usable for work`             IS TRUE
        `is ready to use the home landline for work`      IS TRUE

-- A minister's second aide, appointed 1.1.2005:
`an existing aide of 2005` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` 2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE

-- He is existing, at level ב: 139.2 a month from 1.4.2009, nothing before
-- (the ministry still paid Bezeq), and nothing once two years pass from
-- his signature without a renewal; the day two years on is still in.
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing aide of 2005` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 139.2
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing aide of 2005` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009))
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing aide of 2005` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2011) EQUALS JUST 139.2
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing aide of 2005` (DATE_FROM_DMY 2 4 2011))
#ASSERT `the ministry pays Bezeq directly for the home landline on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2009)
#ASSERT NOT `the ministry pays Bezeq directly for the home landline on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2009)

-- The same post taken up on 1.1.2009 is new, at level א: 96. As the
-- bureau's fourth aide he has no level from annex B, and no refund unless
-- the committee approved one.
`a new aide of 2009` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` 2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
`a fourth new aide of 2009` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` 4 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
`a fourth new aide the committee approved at level A` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` 4 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) FALSE FALSE (JUST `landline level A`) TRUE
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `a new aide of 2009` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 96
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `a fourth new aide of 2009` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010))
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `a fourth new aide the committee approved at level A` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 96

-- An existing deputy director-general is paid at level ג, an associate
-- director-general at level ד; a holder entitled without limit (§1.3), or
-- who never signed, is paid nothing under this instruction.
`an existing deputy director-general` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` 0 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
`an existing associate director-general` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an associate director-general graded 44-46` 0 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing deputy director-general` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 196.8
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an existing associate director-general` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 235.5
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` (`a sample landline holder` `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` 0 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005) FALSE TRUE NOTHING TRUE) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010))
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` (`a sample landline holder` `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` 0 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005) FALSE FALSE NOTHING FALSE) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010))

-- F-2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1-a: a minister's aide
-- acting in the post since 1.10.2008, still acting on 1.12.2008, is both
-- existing (¶2) and new (¶1) as annex A is written, and the two standings
-- are paid 139.2 and 96. As read, he is existing.
`an aide acting since 1.10.2008` MEANS
    `a sample landline holder` `an aide to a minister or deputy minister` 2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2008) TRUE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
`an acting holder of 30.11.2008 is both existing and new as annex A is written` MEANS
        `a new landline holder under annex A as written` `an aide acting since 1.10.2008`
    AND `an existing landline holder under annex A as written` `an aide acting since 1.10.2008`
    AND NOT (`the monthly landline sum under notice edition 1` `an existing landline role holder` `landline level B`
             EQUALS `the monthly landline sum under notice edition 1` `a new landline role holder` `landline level A`)
#ASSERT `an acting holder of 30.11.2008 is both existing and new as annex A is written`
#ASSERT `the landline standing of` `an aide acting since 1.10.2008` EQUALS `an existing landline role holder`
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` `an aide acting since 1.10.2008` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2010) EQUALS JUST 139.2

-- F-2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1-b: read as printed,
-- "עוזרים מקצועיים בכירים לשר ומנהלים כללים" puts directors-general
-- themselves at level ב, paid 139.2, below their own deputies (level ג,
-- 196.8) and associates (level ד, 235.5); the reading that keeps annex B
-- consistent is the aides of a minister and of a director-general.
`a director-general as printed would be paid below his deputy` MEANS
    `the monthly landline sum for an existing holder under notice edition 1` `landline level B`
        LESS THAN `the monthly landline sum for an existing holder under notice edition 1` `landline level C`
#ASSERT `a director-general as printed would be paid below his deputy`

-- The regulative rules on a run of events: the holder signs on approval
-- and renews at month 23; the ministry's accountant need not withhold.
#TRACE `the landline declaration duty` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the landline role holder` DOES `sign the landline declaration` AT 0
    PARTY `the landline role holder` DOES `renew the landline declaration` AT 23

-- §2.3.1 where some existing holders fail annex B: the check, then the
-- referral to the committee.
#TRACE `the check of the existing landline holders` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration` DOES `check the existing holders against annex B, with the accountant` AT 1
    PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration` DOES `refer the holders who fail annex B to the inter-ministerial committee` AT 2
